WEBVTT

00:30:58.750 --> 00:31:01.059
They understand that.

00:31:01.083 --> 00:31:03.976
AG: Once you've figured out
their future goals and concerns,

00:31:04.000 --> 00:31:06.351
you work backward
and ask how they're going to get

00:31:06.375 --> 00:31:08.726
from where they are now
to where they want to be.

00:31:08.750 --> 00:31:10.351
CF: How are you going to do that?

00:31:10.375 --> 00:31:12.476
What is it going to be like
to work outside?

00:31:12.500 --> 00:31:14.184
Once that has been internalized,

00:31:14.208 --> 00:31:19.476
then of course, our human reaction
is to immediately start to go,

00:31:19.500 --> 00:31:22.768
"OK, well, let's find a solution to this."

00:31:22.792 --> 00:31:25.684
AG: It turns out Saudi Arabia
had one crucial interest

00:31:25.708 --> 00:31:29.518
that stood in the way of closing
the climate deal, their economy.

00:31:29.542 --> 00:31:32.768
CF: Saudi Arabia, it has one single export